WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.940
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.210 --> 00:29.320
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.410 --> 00:32.920
[Episode 8]

4
00:36.430 --> 00:37.430
So,

5
00:39.470 --> 00:41.670
you took the surname Ning because of me?

6
00:54.960 --> 00:55.420
Then...

7
00:58.350 --> 01:00.830
he was already obsessed with me back then.

8
01:00.860 --> 01:02.110
Narcissistic personality.

9
01:02.110 --> 01:03.430
Is there any cure for that?

10
01:03.430 --> 01:05.489
From a professional perspective...

11
01:06.870 --> 01:07.800
it's hard to say.

12
01:08.310 --> 01:09.640
It's really hard to say.

13
01:11.070 --> 01:13.270
But I truly waited a very, very long time

14
01:14.310 --> 01:16.230
for the day we reunited.

15
01:18.770 --> 01:25.060
[Duansi Palace]

16
01:56.560 --> 01:57.479
Who are you?

17
02:31.560 --> 02:33.420
Ning Changyue of the Yulin Guard.

18
02:33.870 --> 02:36.400
Greetings, Your Highness Princess Ningjia.

19
02:36.630 --> 02:37.750
Yulin Guard?

20
02:39.030 --> 02:40.360
What do you want with me?

21
02:54.150 --> 02:55.030
This is for you.

22
02:55.310 --> 02:57.590
If you're thirsty, hungry, or in pain,

23
02:57.680 --> 02:59.540
just blow this whistle to find me.

24
03:06.680 --> 03:08.280
It's you.

25
03:11.960 --> 03:13.590
You became a Yulin Guard.

26
03:14.120 --> 03:15.890
Doing quite well for yourself, huh?

27
03:15.890 --> 03:17.020
You've grown taller

28
03:17.240 --> 03:18.240
and stronger.

29
03:18.520 --> 03:20.120
You seem well-trained, too.

30
03:20.720 --> 03:23.440
If not for Your Highness saving my life that day,

31
03:23.710 --> 03:25.710
I probably wouldn't have survived.

32
03:25.750 --> 03:26.610
Your Highness,

33
03:26.670 --> 03:27.740
I am here to repay that debt.

34
03:27.740 --> 03:28.600
Repay the debt?

35
03:28.990 --> 03:30.780
Is this how you repay a debt?

36
03:30.800 --> 03:31.960
That hurt like hell.

37
03:33.800 --> 03:35.910
Forget it. Don't take it to heart.

38
03:35.910 --> 03:38.680
Anyway, I was just

39
03:39.030 --> 03:41.310
being a bit nosy.

40
03:50.000 --> 03:51.360
Make a deal with me.

41
03:57.590 --> 03:58.400
Your Highness.

42
03:58.400 --> 03:59.660
Teach me martial arts,

43
03:59.910 --> 04:01.470
riding and archery.

44
04:02.030 --> 04:02.840
Tell me,

45
04:02.980 --> 04:04.980
what the price of grain is

46
04:05.080 --> 04:06.560
and how much cloth costs

47
04:06.560 --> 04:08.240
in the West Market and East District.

48
04:08.240 --> 04:09.240
How can a painting

49
04:09.360 --> 04:10.760
or a piece of calligraphy

50
04:10.760 --> 04:12.070
be exchanged

51
04:12.150 --> 04:14.150
for enough copper coins to survive?

52
04:16.040 --> 04:17.070
In exchange,

53
04:17.360 --> 04:19.310
I can teach you how to read and draw,

54
04:19.600 --> 04:20.720
if you want to.

55
04:24.310 --> 04:25.240
May I?

56
04:25.950 --> 04:26.600
Of course.

57
04:32.920 --> 04:35.600
I'm willing to serve Your Highness.

58
04:36.480 --> 04:38.000
But what I hope is,

59
04:39.120 --> 04:41.040
not a guard serving a princess,

60
04:41.440 --> 04:43.360
but a person named Ning Changyue

61
04:43.390 --> 04:45.320
teaching a person named Song Yiqiu

62
04:46.040 --> 04:47.900
what it truly means to have a life.

63
04:49.240 --> 04:50.270
To have a life?

64
04:52.870 --> 04:53.720
Your Highness,

65
04:53.720 --> 04:54.850
I don't understand.

66
04:54.920 --> 04:56.430
Call me Song Yiqiu!

67
05:01.160 --> 05:01.720
Alright.

68
05:03.560 --> 05:04.240
Song...

69
05:06.480 --> 05:07.560
Song Yiqiu.

70
05:08.240 --> 05:09.560
It's been a long time,

71
05:10.750 --> 05:12.000
Ning Changyue.

72
05:18.110 --> 05:19.750
To me back then,

73
05:20.630 --> 05:21.360
I didn't know

74
05:21.360 --> 05:23.420
what freedom and having a life meant.

75
05:24.560 --> 05:26.120
But if she wanted them,

76
05:27.120 --> 05:29.120
I would definitely give them to her.

77
05:32.390 --> 05:32.990
By the way,

78
05:42.310 --> 05:43.240
call me anytime.

79
05:45.800 --> 05:46.270
Got it.

80
06:37.940 --> 06:39.950
Having been in this palace for so long,

81
06:39.950 --> 06:42.750
I can't believe I still trusted someone so easily.

82
07:56.500 --> 07:58.230
I made this especially for you.

83
08:03.110 --> 08:04.060
Build up your strength first.

84
08:04.060 --> 08:05.190
If you can't even draw the bow,

85
08:05.190 --> 08:06.850
how can you practice archery?

86
08:08.040 --> 08:10.300
You certainly get straight to the point.

87
08:12.430 --> 08:15.030
Didn't you say you wanted to practice archery?

88
08:31.310 --> 08:31.950
Here.

89
08:38.270 --> 08:38.909
Like this.

90
08:48.440 --> 08:49.360
Raise your arm.

91
09:05.320 --> 09:06.440
Drop shoulders.

92
09:06.840 --> 09:07.360
Song Yiqiu.

93
09:07.360 --> 09:08.360
Calm the mind.

94
09:15.770 --> 09:18.230
This is osmanthus cake from the West Market.

95
09:18.390 --> 09:19.480
The West Market?

96
09:20.560 --> 09:21.960
The West Market is bustling and noisy.

97
09:21.960 --> 09:23.110
Vendors gather there.

98
09:23.110 --> 09:24.630
It's packed with a constant stream of people.

99
09:24.630 --> 09:26.960
It has the liveliest earthly atmosphere.

100
09:27.320 --> 09:27.910
Qiu,

101
09:41.630 --> 09:43.690
this is a kite from the East District.

102
09:44.980 --> 09:46.040
The East District?

103
09:47.440 --> 09:49.270
The East District is full of workshops.

104
09:49.270 --> 09:50.410
There are many tailoring,

105
09:50.410 --> 09:52.740
blacksmith, and silversmith workshops.

106
09:53.850 --> 09:55.050
What are you drawing?

107
09:55.270 --> 09:56.400
You look so focused.

108
09:58.750 --> 09:59.440
Nothing.

109
09:59.910 --> 10:02.440
Just casually sketching the palace scenery.

110
10:03.870 --> 10:05.440
You're drawing the imperial kitchen...

111
10:05.440 --> 10:07.240
Its side door is for servants,

112
10:07.630 --> 10:09.090
so it's rarely patrolled.

113
10:09.760 --> 10:11.040
You observe

114
10:12.180 --> 10:13.260
quite carefully.

115
10:13.980 --> 10:16.440
You're not drawing ordinary palace scenery.

116
10:16.440 --> 10:18.270
You're trying to find a way out,

117
10:18.630 --> 10:19.320
aren't you?

118
10:25.420 --> 10:27.200
How can you fail at the simplest

119
10:27.200 --> 10:28.750
tracing?

120
10:32.100 --> 10:32.820
I'm sorry.

121
10:38.670 --> 10:41.550
You don't need to grip the brush so hard.

122
10:43.070 --> 10:44.530
Once your heart is steady,

123
10:45.000 --> 10:46.460
your brush will be steady.

124
10:47.630 --> 10:48.870
Relax your hand a bit.

125
10:49.180 --> 10:50.310
I'll hold your hand,

126
10:51.240 --> 10:52.640
and we'll draw together.

127
10:53.600 --> 10:54.550
Focus.

128
11:33.790 --> 11:34.650
Ning Changyue,

129
11:34.670 --> 11:35.470
come here now!

130
11:40.260 --> 11:42.300
Over the years, using my memory

131
11:42.330 --> 11:44.380
and overheard information, I drew this map.

132
11:44.380 --> 11:44.950
Look,

133
11:45.200 --> 11:46.800
is this palace map accurate?

134
11:47.000 --> 11:47.750
Pretty much.

135
11:49.010 --> 11:49.970
At 7:45 PM,

136
11:49.990 --> 11:51.240
the guards in the east corridor change shifts.

137
11:51.240 --> 11:52.750
There will be a window of one incense stick's time.

138
11:52.750 --> 11:53.240
Here.

139
11:54.450 --> 11:56.690
The alchemy room shifts every hour.

140
11:56.720 --> 11:59.080
There will be a brief moment of chaos during the shift.

141
11:59.080 --> 12:00.150
If we go this way,

142
12:01.000 --> 12:02.130
and if all goes well,

143
12:02.240 --> 12:04.100
we can leave the palace smoothly.

144
12:04.510 --> 12:05.080
Qiu,

145
12:05.360 --> 12:06.760
I'll take you somewhere.

146
12:07.720 --> 12:09.920
Only when looking from here do I realize

147
12:10.600 --> 12:12.130
just how huge the palace is.

148
12:16.120 --> 12:17.050
A shooting star!

149
12:17.440 --> 12:18.670
We are so lucky.

150
12:23.960 --> 12:24.480
Yeah.

151
12:26.390 --> 12:27.270
So lucky.

152
12:28.870 --> 12:29.930
Make a wish, quick!

153
12:30.240 --> 12:30.670
Hurry!

154
12:33.160 --> 12:38.360
♪ Parting clouds to pluck the moon ♪

155
12:38.970 --> 12:43.600
♪ Brewing a pot of bygone years ♪

156
12:44.800 --> 12:46.360
♪ Cold candlelight ♪

157
12:46.380 --> 12:50.350
♪ Waking the shadow to soothe my sorrow ♪

158
12:50.550 --> 12:55.600
♪ Drunk for three live with no dream returned ♪

159
12:55.750 --> 13:01.360
♪ How to break this illusion without letting go? ♪

160
13:01.380 --> 13:07.430
♪ Returning to wander the mortal realm ♪

161
13:03.750 --> 13:04.950
What did you wish for?

162
13:07.450 --> 13:09.830
♪ Like her like yesterday unchanging ♪

163
13:09.600 --> 13:11.030
It won't come true if I say it out loud.

164
13:09.880 --> 13:13.730
♪ Carved hairpin filled with endless sighs ♪

165
13:13.760 --> 13:18.970
♪ Fate sees through my hidden thoughts ♪

166
13:13.790 --> 13:15.030
Stingy.

167
13:19.170 --> 13:21.270
♪ Like promise like regret like love ♪

168
13:21.300 --> 13:25.380
♪ Loving and hurting yet meeting too late ♪

169
13:21.360 --> 13:22.200
Why don't you ask

170
13:22.200 --> 13:23.240
what I wished for?

171
13:24.440 --> 13:25.170
Freedom.

172
13:25.410 --> 13:30.240
♪ Who holds more regret in this entanglement? ♪

173
13:25.910 --> 13:27.240
You've said it three thousand times.

174
13:27.240 --> 13:28.840
It's etched into your bones.

175
13:32.600 --> 13:33.360
Qiu,

176
13:34.390 --> 13:35.990
on the seventh of next month,

177
13:37.120 --> 13:38.850
I will get you out of the palace.

178
13:44.840 --> 13:46.390
At 7:45 PM,

179
13:46.720 --> 13:48.480
the guards in the east corridor change shifts.

180
13:48.480 --> 13:50.630
There is a gap of one incense stick's time.

181
13:50.630 --> 13:51.630
The seventh?

182
14:03.080 --> 14:04.080
This is...

183
14:05.600 --> 14:07.010
On the seventh of next month,

184
14:07.010 --> 14:08.630
the higher-ups have shown mercy

185
14:08.630 --> 14:10.310
and are letting you leave the palace.

186
14:10.310 --> 14:12.760
Come over here and register your names.

187
14:14.120 --> 14:16.120
That's great. We can finally leave!

188
14:17.960 --> 14:18.960
Thank you, my lord!

189
14:18.960 --> 14:20.000
Don't rush.

190
14:20.110 --> 14:20.990
One at a time.

191
14:21.120 --> 14:22.480
I can finally go home.

192
14:22.690 --> 14:23.530
My lord!

193
14:23.560 --> 14:24.890
Have mercy, my lord!

194
14:25.130 --> 14:26.530
I can't leave the palace.

195
14:26.790 --> 14:28.120
I can't leave!

196
14:28.120 --> 14:30.750
Thank you, my lord.

197
14:31.080 --> 14:33.870
The medicine testers who survived the last failed trials

198
14:33.870 --> 14:36.240
will be dismissed from the palace on the seventh.

199
14:36.240 --> 14:37.570
Xiaoyuan is one of them.

200
14:38.140 --> 14:39.320
You will swap clothes with her

201
14:39.320 --> 14:40.320
and take her place to leave the palace.

202
14:40.320 --> 14:41.270
I swap with her?

203
14:44.550 --> 14:45.150
No way.

204
14:46.960 --> 14:47.910
No way.

205
14:48.700 --> 14:51.250
The chance for a medicine tester to leave alive is so rare.

206
14:51.250 --> 14:53.040
How could I steal her chance to live

207
14:53.040 --> 14:54.560
just for my own freedom?

208
14:54.580 --> 14:55.440
Your Highness,

209
14:56.120 --> 14:57.580
I am doing this willingly.

210
14:57.960 --> 14:59.090
I entered the palace

211
14:59.200 --> 15:01.480
to look for my long-lost brother.

212
15:02.320 --> 15:04.240
Since he is still missing,

213
15:04.910 --> 15:06.390
I cannot leave.

214
15:10.720 --> 15:12.670
As long as you can safely leave the palace on the seventh,

215
15:12.670 --> 15:14.150
I will hide her for a while.

216
15:14.450 --> 15:15.560
Once the heat dies down,

217
15:15.560 --> 15:17.260
I'll find her a position in the palace.

218
15:17.260 --> 15:18.840
This way, she can make a living

219
15:18.840 --> 15:20.510
and continue looking for her brother.

220
15:20.510 --> 15:22.030
This palace isn't that big.

221
15:22.030 --> 15:22.870
As long as she stays,

222
15:22.870 --> 15:24.530
they will meet again someday.

223
15:27.120 --> 15:28.250
The freedom you want

224
15:28.790 --> 15:30.120
is right in front of you.

225
15:47.090 --> 15:48.160
After you leave the palace later,

226
15:48.160 --> 15:49.380
your new identity documents

227
15:49.380 --> 15:50.290
and transit tokens

228
15:50.290 --> 15:52.390
are buried under the third old locust tree.

229
15:52.390 --> 15:53.480
Turn left after exiting,

230
15:53.480 --> 15:54.740
go through two alleys,

231
15:55.120 --> 15:56.550
and when you reach the third narrow door,

232
15:56.550 --> 15:58.270
push it open and you'll find our contact.

233
15:58.270 --> 15:59.600
Carriages, horses, and food,

234
15:59.600 --> 16:02.150
along with the route to Nanjing, are all arranged.

235
16:02.150 --> 16:02.840
Okay.

236
16:04.390 --> 16:05.250
What about you?

237
16:26.480 --> 16:27.750
Your Highness,

238
16:27.770 --> 16:30.810
are you trying to elope with someone?
